The AMHK performs the following tasks:
d. notifying an agency that can provide appropriate professional assistance in cases of domestic violence or child abuse of a report of domestic violence or child abuse or a suspicion thereof, if the interest of the person concerned or the seriousness of the situation to which the report relates gives rise thereto;
